<title>ITALY: Fiat head Romiti sentenced to 18 months.</title>
<headline>Fiat head Romiti sentenced to 18 months.</headline>
<dateline>TURIN, Italy 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cesare Romiti, chairman of Italian carmaker Fiat SpA, was sentenced to 18 months in prison by an Italian judge on Wednesday for false accounting, judicial sources said.</p>
<p>However, this is only the first round of the judicial process and there are further opportunities for Romiti to appeal against the sentence. Under Italian law, sentences of under two years are usually suspended.</p>
</text>
